where $C>0$ only depends on $\beta$ and ${\boldsymbol{\mu}}$. In particular, $V_{\rm v}^{\boldsymbol{\mu}}$ extends to a bounded operator ${\mathcal{D}}(\widetilde{{\mathcal{Q}}}^{+,0})\to{\mathcal{D}}'(\widetilde{{\mathcal{Q}}}^{+,0})$.

