$G_{D,s+t}(e^{-s+{\mathrm{i}}\theta},e^{s-{\mathrm{i}}\theta})$ in $I_{\delta,s,t}(\theta,\theta')$, and use \cref{lemma_lowerB_DGreen} again to get
